---
import DocLayout from "../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
import {
  AGENT_TEASER,
  AUDIT_SLOT,
  CREDIBILITY,
  FEE_POLICY_NOTES,
  FUNCTION_MAP,
  GOVERNANCE_OPENAPI,
  SECURITY_DISCLAIMER,
} from "@token-manager/shared";
---

<DocLayout title="Governance">
  <h1>Governance and agent creates</h1>
  <p>
    Founders can run the journey on the web or MCP. Both surfaces share stage ids.
    The stub session id is <code>stub-shared-session</code>. Live sync is off in Phase 1.
  </p>
  <p>{AGENT_TEASER}</p>
  <p>
    An agent create sets <code>agent_created</code> and <code>no_human</code> on
    <code>CreationActorMeta</code> (<code>actor_type</code> is <code>human</code> or
    <code>agent</code>). Buyers and scanners should read those flags. A human create sets
    both to false.
  </p>

  <h2>Fee policy</h2>
  <ul>
    {
      FEE_POLICY_NOTES.map((item) => (
        <li>
          <code>{item.id}</code> — {item.note}
          {item.discouraged ? " Discouraged." : ""}
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <p>
    <code>fee_policy_list</code> and <code>fee_policy_choose</code> record the path locally.
    They do not move funds. <code>governance_dao_playbook</code> is a pointer for DAO vote
    setup. It does not open a vote or notify the human.
  </p>

  <h2>Post-create lock</h2>
  <p>
    After an agent finalize, <code>PostCreateLock</code> marks mint, LP, and fee admin
    immutable and non-retcon. Humans cannot change those via platform admin for an
    agent-created project. <code>governance_finalize_lock</code> returns that record.
    Phase 1 does not write it on chain.
  </p>

  <h2>Function map</h2>
  <p>
    OpenAPI files in this repo are sketches. <code>live</code> is false. A sketch is not a
    live API. <code>GOVERNANCE_OPENAPI</code> serves no path (
    {GOVERNANCE_OPENAPI.info.description}).
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Function</th>
        <th>Surface</th>
        <th>Served</th>
        <th>Live</th>
        <th>What it is</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {
        FUNCTION_MAP.map((row) => (
          <tr>
            <td>
              <code>{row.id}</code>
            </td>
            <td>{row.surface}</td>
            <td>{row.served ? "yes" : "no"}</td>
            <td>{row.live ? "yes" : "no"}</td>
            <td>{row.summary}</td>
          </tr>
        ))
      }
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Security disclaimer</h2>
  <p>{SECURITY_DISCLAIMER}</p>
  <p>
    Third-party audit slot: auditor is {AUDIT_SLOT.auditor === null ? "empty" : AUDIT_SLOT.auditor},
    completed is {String(AUDIT_SLOT.completed)}. {AUDIT_SLOT.note}
  </p>

  <h2>Credibility</h2>
  <p>{CREDIBILITY.note}</p>
</DocLayout>
